  "applies_to": "TDO340 per the Teracom TDO340 user manual Revision R1.2, firmware V1.03 or later.",
  "summary": "The TDO340 is a Teracom DIN-rail module with four SPST relays (3 A) driven over Modbus RTU RS-485. Relays can be switched as coils or holding registers, and the module has configurable power-up states and a comms-loss watchdog with per-relay actions.",
